      "prose": {
        "text": "To use the `Revoke Subscription` endpoint, your membership Account Holder must sign the Advanced Commerce API Addendum, and you must meet certain eligibility requirements. For more information, see `https://developer.apple.com/in-app-purchase/advanced-commerce-api/`. If the most recent version of this agreement isn’t yet accepted, you can’t call this endpoint, and it returns an error.",
